  {
    "type": "section",
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "defaultValue": "Display Updates"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "defaultValue": "Timer+ normally redraws the time every second. Refreshing less often while the timer is a long way from zero saves battery. Seconds digits which are no longer being refreshed are shown as _."
      },
      {
        "type": "select",
        "messageKey": "tenSecondUpdatesAbove",
        "label": "10-second updates above",
        "description": "Update every 10 seconds while the timer is this far from zero or further, showing 5:3_.",
        "serializeValueAs": "integer",
        "defaultValue": "255",
        "options": [
          { "label": "Never", "value": "255" },
          { "label": "20 seconds", "value": "20" },
          { "label": "40 seconds", "value": "40" },
          { "label": "60 seconds", "value": "60" },
          { "label": "90 seconds", "value": "90" },
          { "label": "120 seconds", "value": "120" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "select",
        "messageKey": "minuteUpdatesAbove",
        "label": "Minute updates above",
        "description": "Update once a minute while the timer is this far from zero or further, showing 5:__. Set at or inside the 10-second setting, minute updates take over completely and the 10-second setting switches itself off.",
        "serializeValueAs": "integer",
        "defaultValue": "255",
        "options": [
          { "label": "Never", "value": "255" },
          { "label": "1 minute", "value": "1" },
          { "label": "2 minutes", "value": "2" },
          { "label": "3 minutes", "value": "3" },
          { "label": "5 minutes", "value": "5" },
          { "label": "7 minutes", "value": "7" },
          { "label": "10 minutes", "value": "10" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "section",
    "capabilities": ["COLOR"],
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "defaultValue": "Colours"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "defaultValue": "Counting down and counting up each have their own colour. Both start green, as they always have been; set them apart and the two modes become easy to tell at a glance, with a timer that runs past zero changing colour as it turns into a stopwatch. The middle and the interval band are shaded from the colour you pick, so the palette holds the colours which stay legible once shaded."
      },
      {
        "type": "color",
        "messageKey": "timerColor",
        "label": "Counting down",
        "defaultValue": "00ff00",
        "sunlight": false,
        "layout": [
          ["ff0000", "ff5500", "ffaa00", "ffff00", "aaff00", "55ff00"],
          ["00ff00", "00ff55", "00ffaa", "00ffff", "00aaff", "0055ff"],
          ["0000ff", "5500ff", "aa00ff", "ff00ff", "ff00aa", "ff0055"],
          ["ff5555", "ffaa55", "ffff55", "aaff55", "55ff55", "55ffaa"],
          ["55ffff", "55aaff", "5555ff", "aa55ff", "ff55ff", "ff55aa"]
        ]
      },
